  "body": "## Summary\n\nFollow-up to #95 for issue #72. Add universal macOS ZIP and DMG packages, a Linux AppImage, and Snap and Flatpak bundles to the release workflow. Snap and Flatpak reuse the Linux release tarball. The macOS app resolves themes from its bundle resources.\n\n## Verification\n\n- AppImage packaging and headless launch passed locally on Fedora.\n- Shell syntax, generated manifest YAML, workflow YAML, and Git patch checks passed.\n- macOS, Snap, and Flatpak runner builds and desktop launch checks remain to be run.\n\nRefs #72\n",
